      "value": "@{5bd570eedbe1156cf5eb1c7e|full_name}: I agree, with most of the vrchat player base already in private worlds, this will only make it worse. If u don’t want a friend request..... simply don’t go to public lobbies. I understand that streamers/youtubers get friends requests just because they r “famous” but just like other games/platforms...... it’s something they should live with even though it may get annoying.",
