      "value": "@{5cd4a07de608892a431932a2|full_name}: Its not about being bothered, it could just be an option for people. A silent way of saying no thanks upfront. I love being in public's but I don't necessarily want to make friends, I just want to have fun. Just an option too, not to really harsh on the whole social part at all. :/ And I don't see the busy state as a solution too. That means the friends I already have can't invite me or they think I am actually busy when I am not.\n\nI get your point, but it would be a nice option. no urgency too.",
